# Pull-to-Refresh on Pages

Every scrollable page (ScrollView, FlatList) should support pull-down-to-refresh.

## Use the `useRefreshable` hook

Import from `src/hooks` and pass `refreshControl` to your scrollable:

```tsx
import { useRefreshable } from "src/hooks";

export default function MyPage() {
  const { refreshControl } = useRefreshable({
    queryKeys: ["myQueryKey"],  // or ["myQuery", param] for parameterized queries
  });

  return (
    <ScrollView refreshControl={refreshControl}>
      {/* content */}
    </ScrollView>
  );
}
```

## With FlatList

```tsx
<FlatList
  data={items}
  refreshControl={refreshControl}
  renderItem={...}
/>
```

## Custom refresh logic

When you need custom logic (e.g. using `refetch` from useQuery):

```tsx
const { refetch } = useQuery({ ... });
const { refreshControl } = useRefreshable({ onRefresh: refetch });
```

## Multiple queries

```tsx
const { refreshControl } = useRefreshable({
  queryKeys: [["topArtists", 50], ["topAlbums"]],
});
```
